{"articleNo":"1690","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1690&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"So Cool!!) 『2011년 대한민국 실전창업리그』 참가자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.04.06","hit":"8959","attachments":[{"name":"참가신청서및사업계획서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1690&attachNo=70191"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">『2011년 대한민국 실전창업리그』참가자 모집</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">우리대학 창업진흥센터는 중소기업청 산하기관인 창업진흥원에서 개최하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">제1회 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2011년 대한민국 실전창업리그』에 참가할 대상자를 모집하여 수상할 수 있도록 적극 지원코자 합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(신청분야)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> IT, 전기․전자, 기계, 화학, 1인 창조기업 분야 등 全산업</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.2pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">타 대회 입상작, 공고일(‘10.12.30) 이전 사업등록자 및 기 사업화된 아이템 등은 제외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(신청자격) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">우수기술․아이디어를 보유한 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">개인 또는 단체(2인 이상)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(응모대상)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦ 학생부 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.6pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">대학 재학(휴학)생으로 구성된 개인 또는 단체</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(신청접수)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦ 신청양식 : 우리대학 홈페이지 공고 참고(4월 8일 공고 예정)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦ 공고일~4월 29일(금) : 사업계획서 작성 및 참가신청서 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 창업진흥센터에서는 참가에 필요한 사업계획서 작성을 지원합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦ 신&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 청 : 4월 27~28일경 창업진흥센터와 협의하여 일괄 신청접수(예정)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">작성완료후 반드시 창업진흥센터와 상의하여 신청하기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">(지역대회 입상시 지원)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\">시제품 제작비, 전문 멘토링, 기술평가, 특허출원, 전시회 참가, IR 연계 등 사업화 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(추진절차)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: right\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt dotted\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">대회 참가팀 모집및 선정</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"26\" height=\"77\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">➡</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt dotted\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"113\" height=\"37\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT